; Ledgeline projection
; projection: Parity rule editor
; created: 2026-10-28
; updated: 2026-10-28

; Plan 30 Phase 4: `= QUERY` rules exactly as the rule editor writes them
; (auto_form::render) — anchored subtree queries, forecast-only, and an
; explicit opposite multiplier on the counter-account instead of an
; amountless posting. The payroll block holds TWO people, so each rule fires
; twice in one transaction: hledger refuses that with an amountless leg and
; reads it fine in this form.

account revenue:sales                                    ; type: R
account expenses:people-costs:wages-salaries             ; type: X
account expenses:people-costs:wages-salaries:george      ; type: X
account expenses:people-costs:wages-salaries:john        ; type: X
account expenses:people-costs:payroll-tax                ; type: X
account expenses:people-costs:employer-tax               ; type: X
account expenses:people-costs:sales-commission:residual  ; type: X
account expenses:bank-fees                               ; type: X
account liabilities:payroll-tax-payable                  ; type: L
account assets:mercury:checking                          ; type: C

= ^expenses:people-costs:wages-salaries(:|$) tag:_generated-transaction  ; payroll tax
    expenses:people-costs:payroll-tax  *0.1
    assets:mercury:checking            *-0.1

= ^expenses:people-costs:wages-salaries(:|$) tag:_generated-transaction
    liabilities:payroll-tax-payable     *-0.0765
    expenses:people-costs:employer-tax  *0.0765

= ^revenue:sales(:|$) tag:_generated-transaction  ; sales commission
    expenses:people-costs:sales-commission:residual  *-0.03
    assets:mercury:checking                          *0.03

= ^revenue:sales(:|$) tag:_generated-transaction amt:>1000
    expenses:bank-fees       $25
    assets:mercury:checking  $-25

~ monthly  payroll
    expenses:people-costs:wages-salaries:george   $6000.00
    expenses:people-costs:wages-salaries:john     $5000.00
    assets:mercury:checking

~ every 1st Apr from 2027  Lucid Software
    revenue:sales            $-40000.00
    assets:mercury:checking

~ monthly from 2027-02  subscriptions
    revenue:sales               $-900.00
    assets:mercury:checking
